  </div>
  <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px">
    <!-- Card 1 -->
    <article class="rv card" style="flex: 1 1 320px; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 24px; padding: 8px; box-shadow: 0 0 2px rgba(0,0,0,.12), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.08), 0 8px 24px rgba(14,23,38,.06); display: flex; flex-direction: column; transition-delay: 25ms">
      <div style="border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; height: 168px">
        <div class="zoom" aria-hidden="true" style="height: 100%; background-color: #0B0D3A; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(108,123,255,.14) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(108,123,255,.14) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 28px 28px; position: relative">
          <div style="position: absolute; right: -30px; bottom: -30px; width: 190px; height: 150px; border: 6px solid #3DF5A1; border-radius: 28px"></div>
          <div style="position: absolute; right: -10px; bottom: -10px; width: 140px; height: 104px; border: 6px solid #22D3EE; border-radius: 22px"></div>
          <div style="position: absolute; right: 12px; bottom: 12px; width: 92px; height: 60px; background: #1B8F6A; border-radius: 14px; opacity: .8"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 24px 24px 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; flex: 1">
        <p style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #3B4A63">Caso real</p>
        <h3 style="font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 600; color: #0E1726">Un agente de IA atendió unas 20 consultas por día en un consultorio</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #17253D">Instagram, n8n y Google Calendar: cómo se armó el agente de turnos y qué cambiaría hoy.</p>
        <a href="#contacto" class="alink" style="margin-top: auto"><span class="sq" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M5 2 L10 7 L5 12" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>Leer el caso</a>
      </div>
    </article>

